      "PrivateCharter.VO__GROUND_SERVICE__PrivateCharter__Generic__PushComplete__020__M__Generic__3": "Менi час. Щасливого шляху!",
      "PrivateCharter.VO__MAIN_CHARACTER1__PrivateCharter__Generic__ArrivedHappyBeforeLanding__010__M__Generic__1": "Ми вже прилетiли?",
      "PrivateCharter.VO__MAIN_CHARACTER1__PrivateCharter__Generic__ArrivedHappyBeforeLanding__010__M__Generic__2": "Ми вже прибули? Чудово!",
      "PrivateCharter.VO__MAIN_CHARACTER1__PrivateCharter__Generic__ArrivedHappyBeforeLanding__010__M__Generic__3": "Долетiли наче за секунду!",
